            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="1365" n="[1338]" xml:id="pg1338"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi>, 1977–1980, Volume VIII, Arab-Israeli Dispute, January
                    1977–August 1978. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been revised.
                    <!--Revised information is in italic.--></p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d14">Document 14</ref>, Page 112
                            (date of correction: May 11, 2015)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>Please note that in footnote 14, King Khalid was mistakenly identified as
                        King Faisal. The meeting also only included Vance, Fahd, and Saud.
                        Additional citation information has also been added.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
